# Requisições de exemplo para explorar a API pelo editor.
# VS Code: extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) → clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.
# Requer o compose rodando: bun run infra:up  (as chamadas passam pelo nginx → 3 réplicas)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Criar wallet com saldo inicial (gera OPENING + lançamento CREDIT na mesma transação)
# @name createWallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "playerId": "{{$guid}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "1000.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Consultar a wallet criada acima
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}

### Extrato (mais recente primeiro). Para a próxima página, use ?cursor=<nextCursor>
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}/ledger?limit=50

### Reconciliação: saldo armazenado × saldo reconstruído pelo ledger
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}/reconciliation

### Mesma wallet de novo (mesmo player + moeda) → 409 WALLET_ALREADY_EXISTS
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{createWallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "5.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Valor fora do formato (escala fixa de 2 casas) → 400 INVALID_PAYLOAD
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{$guid}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "10.5", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Wallet inexistente → 404 WALLET_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{$guid}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apostas
### BET de 25.00 na wallet criada acima → 201 PROCESSED
# @name bet
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-demo-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-demo-1",
  "playerId": "{{createWallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{createWallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Mesma requisição de novo → 200, idempotentReplay: true, saldo original
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-demo-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-demo-1",
  "playerId": "{{createWallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{createWallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Mesma key, valor diferente → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-demo-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-demo-1",
  "playerId": "{{createWallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{createWallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "99.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### REFUND da BET → 201 (saldo volta); envie de novo com outro id para ver 422 REFERENCE_ALREADY_REVERSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:refund-demo-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "refund-demo-1",
  "playerId": "{{createWallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{createWallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "REFUND",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" },
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "bet-demo-1"
}

### ROLLBACK de uma BET que ainda não chegou → 202 PENDING_REFERENCE
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:rollback-demo-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "rollback-demo-1",
  "playerId": "{{createWallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{createWallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "ROLLBACK",
  "money": { "amount": "10.00", "currency": "BRL" },
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "bet-demo-late"
}

### Consultar a BET pelo id interno
GET {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions/{{bet.response.body.transactionId}}

### Consultar pelo id do provider
GET {{baseUrl}}/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/bet-demo-1

### Health e métricas (sem autenticação)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
